          "section": "RULE-5",
          "section_title": "RULE 5 - DEDUCTIBLE FACTORS",
          "ref": "5.1",
          "page": 3,
          "text": "5.1 Where MM-CP-E310 Windstorm or Hail Percentage Deductible is attached, apply factor WH-2 (0.92) for a 2% deductible or WH-5 (0.85) for a 5% deductible to the COV-A and COV-B premium in territories FL-T03 and TX-T01.",
