          "text": "8.1 A CC4 office building (class code 0745) in territory FL-T03 with COV-A limit $4,000,000, PC4, $5,000 deductible, 5% windstorm deductible (MM-CP-E310) and full sprinklers (SPR-1 with MM-CP-E415): 4,000,000 / 100 x 0.240 x 1.45 x 1.00 x 0.95 x 0.80 x 0.85 = $8,992 COV-A premium before fees.",
